[{"title":"从军行（八首。并序） 其八","author":"罗颀","text":"里中遇故人，相与语畴昔。\n归家门户静，阶除少行迹。\n蚯蚓穴砌间，絺蛸网四壁。\n抚事多踟蹰，不知时节易。\n上堂拜双亲，入室长太息。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":12561,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游仙诗二首 其一","author":"罗颀","text":"蟠木倚沧溟，花开隐耀灵。\n高临四海碧，下视九州青。\n地远无风雨，天低动日星。\n不须乘鹤去，三岛亦浮萍。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":12562,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游仙诗二首 其二","author":"罗颀","text":"幽径赤城颠，松萝九曲连。\n千林喧药杵，一嶂起茶烟。\n深窦源通海，层岩树隐天。\n携琴就猿鹤，同种玉峰田。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":12563,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送下洋客","author":"罗颀","text":"积木连樯杳，烟涛绝域均。\n星河插天秤，日月转波轮。\n地坼炎洲迥，山横昧谷邻。\n岩鸡半夜晓，海树隔年春。\n玳瑁沙笼蜃，珊瑚窟聚滨。\n风帆摇鲎媚，霜杼响鲛人。\n五色翻鲸浪，三花渡鹤津。\n乡心看斗近，旅梦怯潮频。\n灯远明南极，舟移按北辰。\n刀书藩俗古，行说上皇民。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":12564,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"陇头水","author":"高瓛","text":"陇坂崎岖陇水长，征人陇上望家乡。\n停车驻马不能渡，呜咽声中欲断肠。\n抽刀斩水水不绝，拔山塞川川更咽。\n前军洗疮血尚存，后军滴泪水复浑。\n丈夫有志沙场死，未到陇头愁塞耳。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":12565,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋日逆旅送友人","author":"高璧","text":"七泽波涛险，三边道路穷。\n同悲迹类梗，独咏首如蓬。\n晚色平芜外，秋声落木中。\n毋将衰飒泪，临别洒西风。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":12566,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"岁暮柯亭道中","author":"朱显","text":"行旅正纷然，危亭古道边。\n晚峰千树雪，寒陇几家烟。\n孤棹荒城外，归心去鸟前。\n浮踪未能定，况复值残年。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":12567,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄龚大章","author":"张倬","text":"半生心迹任虚舟，风雪飘萧一弊裘。\n独抱龙门太平策，沧浪亭下看沙鸥。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":12568,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"画竹","author":"张倬","text":"黄陵祠下月明多，不见湘灵翠辇过。\n留得萧萧数竿竹，至今肠断楚人歌。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":12569,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送沈彦修","author":"丁岳","text":"江上秋风吹客衣，江边把酒对斜晖。\n江鸥不解离人意，故作三三两两飞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":12570,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送客","author":"丁岳","text":"芦花飞雪水增波，一曲尊前感慨歌。\n客里可堪频送客，眼中知己渐无多。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":12571,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"古风","author":"丁岳","text":"麒麟四灵长，群兽孰敢当。\n木精著文彩，肉角仁且良。\n生草既不折，生虫亦不伤。\n在鲁何成悲，来周乃致祥。\n一去余千载，中原有豺狼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":12572,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"谢寄符","author":"平显","text":"百道仙符下武当，电光随绕读书堂。\n诗魔惧挟文穷遁，酒圣灵驱疟鬼藏。\n墨汁润分瑶草色，篆文清带榔花香。\n壁琴自此如神助，长觉风霆响洞房。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":12573,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题黄鹤山人王叔明画","author":"平显","text":"我昔见之湖上居，当门万朵翠芙蕖。\n承平公子有故态，文敏外孙多异书。\n闲吮彩毫消白日，梦骑黄鹤上清虚。\n此图定倚吴山阁，醉点南屏春雨馀。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":12574,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题梅得芳杏林图","author":"施敬","text":"梅仙炼丹处，山杏栽无数。\n卖药到人间，衣裳带红雾。\n花开不知岁，子落还成树。\n我欲与之言，飘然骑虎去。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":12575,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送人还广陵","author":"施敬","text":"会晤情方洽，暌违意更长。\n天涯同是客，秋杪各还乡。\n黄叶飞扬子，青山绕夜郎。\n分襟即万里，相顾两茫茫。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":12576,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"归燕","author":"施敬","text":"已知秋社近，更绕画梁飞。\n主意岂不念，天时难独违。\n双归辽海远，对语夕阳稀。\n花雨重来日，故巢还是非。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":12577,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"沙津送客登望江亭","author":"施敬","text":"沙市津头送客行，西风江树数蝉鸣。\n夕阳霭霭千山暝，秋水迢迢双鹭明。\n蔓草已芜王粲宅，乱云长绕吕蒙营。\n登临不用携尊酒，若个能平感慨情。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":12578,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄伯瞻","author":"施敬","text":"别后悠悠渺所思，使来浑不寄新诗。\n云林一去无多地，风雨相违又许时。\n芣苢绿深江路草，枇杷黄尽客窗枝。\n多情惟有西斋月，曾照清宵醉酒卮。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":12579,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋塘曲","author":"施敬","text":"莲谢秋塘晚，风来野水香。\n采莲休采叶，留盖睡鸳鸯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":12580,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"巴阳夜泊","author":"施敬","text":"独棹三巴夜，秋高片月孤。\n滩声将客梦，万里下东吴。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":12581,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"塞上曲","author":"施敬","text":"八月秋高塞草斑，将军千骑猎前山。\n弯弓不射南飞雁，恐有征人附信还。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":12582,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"南行途中寄钱塘亲友","author":"施敬","text":"万里移家入瘴烟，故乡音耗若为传。\n衡阳自古无来雁，况去衡阳又八千。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":12583,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"读程原道昆阳诗怅然有怀","author":"施敬","text":"昆阳市上美人家，饮酒曾停过客车。\n万里相思不相见，东风吹尽蜜檀花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":12584,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"试笔","author":"施敬","text":"试笔山窗竹影凉，闲临小字换鹅章。\n定巢燕子时飞过，带得残花落纸香。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":12585,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"江上秋怀","author":"杨子善","text":"水国风高木叶霜，满舟山色入荒凉。\n小孤残照收江左，大别寒烟锁汉阳。\n新饭软炊菰米白，浊醪香泛菊花黄。\n故乡千里空回首，云树茫茫鬓发苍。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":12586,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"书怀","author":"杨子善","text":"舵楼空阔望京华，芦荻江枫岸岸花。\n山色淡浓昏雾薄，水光浮没夕阳斜。\n故乡鸿雁书千里，远浦牛羊屋数家。\n边塞柳营多苜蓿，石田复忆旧桑麻。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":12587,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次韵二首 其二","author":"胡粹中","text":"昨夜霜初重，他方叶又黄。\n蛩声悲月冷，客意怯风凉。\n孤屿渔村外，荒邮野戍傍。\n因思旧游处，鱼稻满江乡。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":12588,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"挽光古逯先生","author":"胡粹中","text":"独骑玄鹤上丹丘，为记钧天白玉楼。\n诗板刊成应自校，草书零落有谁收。\n可能觅酒府中去，无复携筇寺里游。\n欲寄东风一行泪，蜀江不肯向西流。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":12589,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"挽鉴机先和尚","author":"胡粹中","text":"曾将一苇渡瀛洲，信脚中原万里游。\n日出扶桑极东处，云归滇海最西头。\n经留髹几香犹灺，棋敛纹楸子未收。\n老我飘蓬江汉上，几回中夜惜汤休。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":12590,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄杨子东","author":"周昉","text":"钱塘旧友知谁在，万里滇南见子东。\n夜市斗茶凉雨后，晴湖载酒夕阳中。\n龙梭织锦翻新样，凤绣萦丝记旧工。\n不是吾侪不归去，六桥行处草茸茸。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":12591,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题蓬莱深处","author":"韩宜可","text":"闻道蓬莱别有春，五云深处隔凡尘。\n松迷鹤径浑无路，花暗箫声不见人。\n沧海日华翻贝阙，三山霞气逐飙轮。\n刘郎自是神仙侣，何用天台更问津。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":12592,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"登秀山咏云（宜可在谴谪时，故托寓如此）","author":"韩宜可","text":"突兀峰峦入翠微，白云如练久相依。\n只堪仙子裁春服，曾与君王补衮衣。\n风里卷舒还有态，眼前聚散本无机。\n一从醉抱山头石，未得从龙万里飞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":12593,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"早起","author":"杨彝","text":"一声残角数声鸡，南斗高悬北斗低。\n多少行人度关去，东方曙色尚凄迷。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":12594,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"访友人居","author":"逯昶","text":"携书访故人，岂惮往来频。\n潭净开天镜，山昏著雾巾。\n林居常扫叶，石径不吹尘。\n幽僻宜沦隐，时时得句新。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":12595,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"郊墟池馆","author":"逯昶","text":"何人小池馆，闲得在郊墟。\n花晚留栖蝶，萍朝见跃鱼。\n幽墀滋藓晕，老竹带虫书。\n自计无钱买，凭谁可借居。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":12596,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游广东清远峡山寺","author":"逯昶","text":"寂寂长林下，僧房锁碧苔。\n树枝猿挂折，花片鸟衔来。\n池溢流过水，炉存爇后灰。\n赋诗殊未就，徙倚故迟回。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":12597,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"登浪穹县护民寺","author":"逯昶","text":"浪穹西阜寺，独眺有馀情。\n落日秋山色，西风古树声。\n征衣怜旧弊，客路喜新晴。\n洗钵焚香事，谁能了此生。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":12598,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"古渊房闲书和韵","author":"逯昶","text":"禅房碧树深，坐久语幽禽。\n叶罅日穿透，林端云过阴。\n笔新微蘸墨，书故少生蟫。\n僧有思乡者，时时亦起吟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":12599,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"月堂室中闲题","author":"逯昶","text":"清心投静室，童子启云关。\n秋色老著树，夕阳明在山。\n高崖泉落响，远汉鸟飞还。\n扰扰红尘里，无如僧最闲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":12600,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"简泽雨田","author":"逯昶","text":"花时曾惜别，菊候又相逢。\n落日深山道，清风古寺钟。\n往来非定迹，彼此是衰容。\n何日随师去，栖禅共竹松。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":12601,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题淘金驿丞谢子良清隐书房","author":"朱綝","text":"驿官近日逢迎少，清隐何妨结草堂。\n门对好山苍雾湿，窗连脩竹翠云凉。\n侍童解诵《闲居赋》，过客求书《急就章》。\n愧我驱驰尘满面，濯缨为尔咏沧浪。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":12602,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"行路难","author":"黎扩","text":"行路何难？\n尘沙如霰。\n尘以涅衣，沙以垢面。\n行路何难？\n路行多阻。\n水渡无梁，山行有虎。\n我欲行路，路苦难行。\n虽有尘沙，尚全吾生。\n水虽无梁，不渡由我。\n我遭猛虎，曷为而可？","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":12603,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"拟古","author":"黎扩","text":"乘此日少霁，辞君将远游。\n所游虽云远，前途契深求。\n鸟归认旧林，狐死怀故丘。\n微物尚有知，吾心安所尤。\n清时不屡得，欲往步难北。\n回首仰日光，复被浮云隔。\n鬓发变秋霜，衣带减畴昔。\n此意难重陈，重陈复何益。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":12604,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"西灞草堂为庐陵宋内翰赋二首 其一","author":"黎扩","text":"闻说西溪上，春风小院开。\n野蚕成茧尽，江燕引雏回。\n竹里围棋局，荷香沁酒杯。\n晚凉疏雨过，随意步苍苔。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":12605,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"西灞草堂为庐陵宋内翰赋二首 其二","author":"黎扩","text":"闻说西溪上，波光映远天。\n吟蛩催急杵，落雁近渔船。\n红树斜晖淡，黄花晓露鲜。\n田家新酿熟，共醉月明边。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":12606,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送人还旴江","author":"黎扩","text":"新凉生白苎，游子倍凄然。\n客思秋砧外，乡心旅雁前。\n西风千里道，斜月五更船。\n亦有还家梦，随君到汝川。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":12607,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山茶","author":"黎扩","text":"叶苦寒摧绿，花愁雪妒红。\n自知荣适晚，不敢恨春风。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":12608,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"洞庭秋月","author":"黎扩","text":"湖上清秋夜，扁舟泛碧波。\n紫箫吹不断，无奈月明何。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":12609,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"渔樵耕牧（四首） 其一","author":"黎扩","text":"渔水心情淡淡，鸥波身世悠悠。\n清风杨柳一曲，明月芦花满洲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":12610,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"渔樵耕牧（四首） 其二","author":"黎扩","text":"窈窈径穿林下，丁丁斧彻云间。\n耳惯猿惊鹤怨，迹穷红树青山。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":12611,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"渔樵耕牧（四首） 其三","author":"黎扩","text":"南村北村雨足，十亩五亩秧齐。\n带月肩犁未出，催人布谷先啼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":12612,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"渔樵耕牧（四首） 其四","author":"黎扩","text":"芳草茸茸暖碧，乌犍湿湿春肥。\n满蓑烟雨朝出，一笛斜阳暮归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":12613,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"感讽","author":"苏大","text":"兵刃何最贵？\n七首同干将。\n所铸皆匪凡，用有祥不祥。\n荆柯信国士，未抵专诸勇。\n阖庐因成功，燕国几亡种。\n所托若匪雄，不如投闲余。\n免令将军头，不及筵中鱼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":12614,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山房睡起","author":"苏大","text":"砌草茸茸石径斜，竹篱茅舍带江沙。\n昼长睡起多情思，看遍林阴商陆花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":12615,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"泊雷港有作 其四","author":"唐文凤","text":"晚泊豁吟怀，行行步渚沙。\n雨添新柳耳，水减嫩蒲芽。\n乌鬼来渔艇，青蚨付酒家。\n微风吹短褐，倚杖数归鸦。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":12616,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"孟秋陪祀","author":"任道","text":"亲王代祀抚松楸，玉座金门敞素秋。\n日月丽文深睿想，风云齐仗俨神游。\n钟离树老幻宫壮，芒砀山高王气浮。\n此日彤庭瞻拜地，祠光应彻五城楼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":12617,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"画菜","author":"任道","text":"露芽烟甲曙光寒，紫翠漙香湿未干。\n记得花开曾病酒，玉人纤手荐春盘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":12618,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"太学夜宿","author":"石光霁","text":"蜡炬烧残夜二更，高斋萧爽客怀清。\n山林只在虚檐外，错把风声作雨声。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":12619,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"东浦夜泊","author":"谢绩","text":"日落潮生浦，天空月上沙。\n归舟与飞鸟，相趁入芦花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":12620,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春日杂兴二首 其一","author":"周启","text":"门对江村八九家，红尘昼静寂无哗。\n凤巢遥傍新移竹，鱼浪轻吹细落花。\n春剪未开深院响，野壶时过短墙赊。\n少年几许须行乐，莫惜芳尊赏物华。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":12621,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春日杂兴二首 其二","author":"周启","text":"一片残红落紫苔，笙歌无梦到楼台。\n溪山昼锁石桥断，山雨夜添春水来。\n江上客扶归马醉，柳阴人唤打鱼回。\n不知上苑花开否，无路行看羯鼓催。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":12622,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"吊席心斋炼师和少师姚公韵","author":"周矩","text":"冠裳已葬海虞峰，竹下茶瓯不复同。\n华表人归身是鹤，葛陂仙去杖成龙。\n七星桧老瑶坛静，午夜猿悲蕙帐空。\n徒遣友朋怀远致，驿亭惆怅立西风。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":12623,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"王均章画虞山图","author":"周矩","text":"中阳山人思超逸，图写江山用金碧。\n沧海红尘几度飞，尚有人间留妙迹。\n层峦万叠烟雾浮，禅宫道院当山头。\n浮屠屹立遥汉外，危石正瞰清溪流。\n平桥渡水西林去，草屋茅亭隔烟树。\n童子携筇独鹤随，仙人背立溪桥路。\n前山矗矗知几重，悬崖怒瀑飞晴虹。\n渔舟影没汀树远，牧童声断江天空。\n中阳妙手谁复拟，咫尺依稀如万里。\n仙岩有路疑可到，便欲振衣凌拂水。\n君不见吴山吴水南海堧，随闇老人留七年。\n红桥画舫姑苏市，晚稻香粳湖上田。\n江山千里总奇绝，我昔思归情惘然。\n还君此画一长叹，花外声声啼杜鹃。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":12624,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题樱桃翠羽图","author":"侯复","text":"几点丹砂照绿阴，瑶池内使翠霞襟。\n东风何处曾相识，沉水香消午院深。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":12625,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送玉笥王道赴京有代祝岳渎之行","author":"彭镛","text":"王子缑山载碧笙，远随丹诏觐神京。\n秩宗祀典虞书在，封禅坛泬汉畤平。\n玉笥云连龙虎气，金陵天近凤凰城。\n祝官拜望承恩早，小朵楼西散佩声。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":12626,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"凤凰台","author":"董儒","text":"台上吹箫作凤声，凤凰相应共和鸣。\n一从仙侣乘云去，几听遗音傍月明。\n芳草洲前闲宿鹭，乌衣巷口语流莺。\n可怜虎踞山边土，频筑南朝六代城。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":12627,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"客夜（《诗删》作郑起）","author":"黄褧","text":"西风萧萧木叶稀，秋深作客何时归。\n城头月出照击柝，江上露白催捣衣。\n雁鸿附书远莫致，鸟鹊绕树还惊飞。\n三更不眠欲起舞，跃马卧龙谁是非。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":12628,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"南阁病中兼寄黄玄之","author":"黄褧","text":"水市南头昼掩扉，衰容垂柳共依依。\n雁来高阁春归尽，雀下闲门客过稀。\n对酒花枝怜独卧，盍簪芳草念多违。\n凭君为问清吟处，何日相从赋《采薇》。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":12629,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}}]